{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12647","headline":"系乐府十二首 思太古 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 思太古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南三千里，沅湘爲太湖。\n湖上山谷深，有人多似愚。\n婴孩寄树颠，就水捕鷠鲈。\n所欢同鸟兽，身意复何拘。\n吾行遍九州，此风皆已无。\n吁嗟圣贤敎，不觉久踌蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}